fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"applib/gstappsink.html#GstAppSinkNewEventCallback","fragment":"\n\tGstAppSinkNewEventCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSinkNewEventCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSinkNewEventCallback\n\nCalled when a new event is available. This callback is called from the\nstreaming thread. The new event can be retrieved with\ngst_app_sink_pull_object either from this callback or from any other thread.\nThe callback should return TRUE if the event has been handled, FALSE\notherwise.\nParameters:\na GstAppSink\ncallback user data\nTRUE when the event has been handled.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when a new event is available. This callback is called from the\nstreaming thread. The new event can be retrieved with\nGstApp.AppSink.prototype.pull_object either from this callback or from any other thread.\nThe callback should return true if the event has been handled, false\notherwise.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSink\ncallback user data\ntrue when the event has been handled.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when a new event is available. This callback is called from the\nstreaming thread. The new event can be retrieved with\nGstApp.AppSink.pull_object either from this callback or from any other thread.\nThe callback should return True if the event has been handled, False\notherwise.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSink\ncallback user data\nTrue when the event has been handled.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});